      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">From the coastal dunes of Rockingham to inland Kwinana, we put home owners in touch with an independent structural engineer for walls, cracks, extensions and patio certificates. Call (08) 5550 6237 and find out first whether you need one at all.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
