<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Rockingham and Kwinana are two fast-growing council areas on Perth's south-west coast. The ABS put the City of Rockingham at 159,934 people in June 2025, up 3.2% in a year, and the City of Kwinana at 57,422, up 4.6%, the fastest percentage growth of any council area we cover. More people means more patios, carports, extensions and walls coming out, and more owners staring at a new crack wondering what it means.</p><p>Kings Park Structural Co is a referral service and paid advertising for independent structural engineers. We pass your enquiry to an independent structural engineering firm, which quotes you and contracts with you directly. We don't inspect, design or certify anything ourselves, and we'll tell you straight when a job may not need an engineer at all.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Rockingham & Kwinana</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Rockingham & Kwinana Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #ECE5D8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#15191E;margin:0 0 8px;">Wall removal and beam design</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Taking out a wall for an open-plan kitchen needs a building permit if the wall supports anything else. The engineer who quotes your job checks what the wall carries and designs the beam, posts and footings your builder installs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #ECE5D8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#15191E;margin:0 0 8px;">Crack and structural inspection reports</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Cracks in brickwork, render or cornices near the coast can have several causes, including water washing sand out from under footings. An independent structural engineer looks at the pattern and writes a report, which is a different thing from a pre-purchase building inspection.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #ECE5D8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#15191E;margin:0 0 8px;">Extension and second-storey engineering</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Any change in floor area or height needs a permit, and the City of Rockingham's list for owner-lodged (BA2) applications asks for a structural engineer's details. The engineer who quotes your job prepares those for your builder or building surveyor.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #ECE5D8;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Figtree',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#15191E;margin:0 0 8px;">Patio, carport and shed certificates</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Patios and carports are everywhere in Rockingham and Kwinana, and a roofed patio is not an exempt pergola. An independent engineer can prepare site-specific drawings, footing design and wind calculations for the council application.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
